<translate>
'''Fluid Mask By Index API''' is an API which provides the ability for the [[Item (scripts)|item scripts]] definitions using [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/scripts/item.html#scripts-item-iconsfortexture IconsForTexture], [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/scripts/item.html#scripts-item-staticmodelsbyindex StaticModelsByIndex] and [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/scripts/item.html#scripts-item-worldstaticmodelsbyindex WorldStaticModelsByIndex] to have [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/scripts/item.html#scripts-item-worldstaticmodelsbyindex IconFluidMask] applied by index instead of a singular fluid mask for every item variants.
</translate>
